{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Young图表"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Young 图表"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>Young 图</strong> (Young diagram, Alfred Young) 是一种方格状图表, 由若干行列构成, 每行 (每列) 的方格数量递减.</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccccc}\r\n\\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square\\\\\r\n\\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\square &amp; \\\\\r\n\\square &amp; \\square &amp; &amp;&amp;\\\\\r\n\\square &amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>Young 图可用于表现许多对象, 如</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正整数的分拆</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称群","text":"对称群"}},{"Plain":"的共轭类</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Schur函子","text":"Schur 函子"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 Young 图里填一些正整数, 每行递增, 每列严格递增, 称为 <strong>Young 表</strong> (tableau).</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n{ccccc}\r\n1 &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 3 &amp; 4\\\\\r\n2 &amp; 3 &amp; 5 &amp; 5 &amp; \\\\\r\n4 &amp; 5 &amp; &amp;&amp;\\\\\r\n5 &amp;&amp;&amp;&amp;\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}